  "display_title": "Love Recycling",
  "description": "Denis, who lives off the rich, has a trashy life together with his lover, Hugo. But he gets kicked out after getting caught for wasting all his money on gambling. Before Denis finds a new rich to live off on, he steals a bag for his living expenses. \n\nAs he ran away with the stolen bag, he bumps into the partner of the bag's owner 'Yoon-Hwan'.\nYoon-Hwan sees the keyring on the stolen bag Denis was holding and misunderstands him as his partner.\n\nAs soon as Denis sees him, he can tell that Yoon-Hwan was quite wealthy. So he decides to pretend he is his partner...\n\n*'What is this.... Do I really like him? Because he's my type?'*\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
